{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026mlW7kw2Oom1792670154.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>薔琵減弱為強颱風，迫近台灣，氣象部門發布海上陸上颱風警報，台北市宣布周五停工停課。</p><p></p><p>花蓮海邊有湧浪，南濱橋出現海水倒灌，有飄浮的樹木和雜物湧入河道。花蓮市內有大樹被強風吹倒，砸中路邊的攤檔，無人受傷。</p><p></p><p><br/> <p><br/> <img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.WEATHER-1830_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026vDanCLOQIS1792673500.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><br/> </p><br/></p><p></p><p>氣象部門指，薔琵中心附近最大風力達16級，將為台灣北部及東部帶來暴雨，預料薔琵逐漸向台灣東北沿海靠近，強度緩慢減弱，周五晚會轉為偏北方向移動。其後在浙江東部近海轉向東北，趨向日本西南部、上海、浙江、福建等地都會有暴雨，福建小三通客運航線，自中午起全部停航。</p><p></p><p><br/> <p><br/> <img alt=\"Picture_J.CN.WEATHER-1830_004.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026gF3Dac5Mi81792673520.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><br/> </p><br/></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T15:41:28.373384+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":229,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T14:47:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T08:58:09.734826+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T15:37:15.637657+00:00","content_hash":"bba32342c43e5a950d6e0ee2499b2acd95436c496da56d52814cebab53b08926","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-22T15:41:28.373384+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}